Afgestudeerd? What’s next? Stap in bij het HSO Young Professional Program! Kickstart je IT-carrière ! Klaar voor de reis? Join the journey to explore!

Start jouw carrière als Functioneel Consultant bij HSO en geef je toekomst een vliegende start op 1 maart 2027. In ons Young Professional Program ontwikkel je jezelf razendsnel tot een specialist in Microsoft Dynamics 365 Customer Engagement (CE), met AI als jouw versnellingsmotor.&nbsp;

Jouw start bij HSO&nbsp;
Je begint met een vijfweekse Masterclass waarin je alles leert over Dynamics 365 CE, Microsoft-technologie en de nieuwste ontwikkelingen op het gebied van AI en automatisering. Je traint op zowel technische vaardigheden als soft skills, zoals klantgericht adviseren, samenwerken en communiceren. Na afronding behaal je je officiële Microsoft-certificering.&nbsp;

Snel aan de slag bij topklanten&nbsp;
Na de Masterclass ga je direct aan de slag binnen een ervaren projectteam. Je werkt mee aan digitale transformaties bij klanten als Rituals, Royal BAM en Heineken. Als Functioneel Consultant analyseer je bedrijfsprocessen, vertaal je klantbehoeften naar slimme oplossingen, implementeer je Dynamics 365 CE en begeleid je klanten bij adoptie en optimalisatie van AI-tools zoals Copilot. Jij bent de verbindende schakel tussen business en technologie.&nbsp;

Groei in je eigen tempo&nbsp;
Je staat er nooit alleen voor. Je krijgt begeleiding van een senior consultant, ondersteuning van je manager en een leertraject via de HSO Academy. Je groeit van Trainee naar Junior Consultant en kunt daarna doorgroeien naar Medior of zelfs Lead Consultant - afhankelijk van jouw ambitie, bijvoorbeeld richting AI-integratie, procesoptimalisatie of klantstrategie.&nbsp;&

About WPP Media

WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships - all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open - we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. 

WPP Media is WPP's AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.

For more information, visit wppmedia.com .

About WPP Media&nbsp;

WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&nbsp;

WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&nbsp;

At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&nbsp;

• Be Extraordinary by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.&nbsp;

• Create an Open environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.&nbsp;

• Lead Optimistically by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&nbsp;

Role Summary and Impact

As part of the Global Operations Centre (GOC) , The Organic Performance Director’s primary role is to lead and manage their specific clients. They are directly responsible for the strategy, performance, financial and team management, and delivery of all SEO work. A key part of the role is to deliver class-leading client service to maintain and improve the strength of the relationship with our clients. To have a proven track record in SEO and a good understanding of general digital marketing, supported by an understanding of campaign and digital content marketing, with expertise in the strategic implications and practical applications of AI, Large Language Models (LLMs), and generative search experiences. We are looking for a Director, SEO, GOC who will:

• Be responsible for the delivery of the SEO and organic content strategies through effective management and delivery of client’s strategy to deliver growth against the set KPI’s.

• This will be achieved through the development of the team under your management and by gaining team satisfaction via 360º and informal feedback.

• This includes pioneering new strategies to optimise for generative search results and leveraging AI-driven content approaches.

• Be responsible for the defence of existing client revenues and grow commercial opportunities through supporting and leading new business opportunities, positioning Wavemaker a WPP Media Brand as a leader in AI-driven organic performance.

• Make an active contribution to the development, growth, and success of the Organic Performance team and Wavemaker a WPP Media Brand, especially in fostering expertise and best practices around AI, LLMs, and the future of search.

• Above all ensure that we deliver award winning for client work under your responsibility, setting benchmarks for performance in an AI-augmented search landscape.

• Drive the strategic vision for integrating AI and LLMs across all organic performance initiatives, from content creation to technical SEO and reporting.

• Serve as a primary thought leader Wavemaker a WPP Media Brand’s capability in generative AI and future-of-search strategies to both clients and the wider industry.

